      <Item>Recovery variable $w$ slowly increases, eventually pushing trajectory back left</Item>
      <Item>$v$ rapidly decreases as trajectory follows left branch back toward rest (downstroke)</Item>
      <Item>Both variables return to stable fixed point (refractory period ends)</Item>
    </SortedItems>
  </SortQuiz>

